"coach.variant.ɪː" = "/ɪː/ can represent a long monophthongal NEAR. Keep the vowel steady without requiring a separate schwa.";
"coach.variant.ʊː" = "/ʊː/ can represent a long monophthongal CURE. Keep the /ʊ/ quality and follow the lesson reference rather than replacing it with /uː/.";

